          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A 12,000 watt generator is near-whole-house power for a gas-heated home, but the label covers machines from 9,500 to 12,000 running watts and 211 to 347 lb. Size on running watts, use the 50-amp outlet with a matching inlet and switch, and plan your fuel before the outage, not during it.
          </p>
